  [1mVerification.[0m Both files pass [38;5;153mnode --check[39m. I smoke-tested [38;5;153mlogin[39m in isolation under Node by extracting the function
  and evaluating it alongside [38;5;153mtracking.js[39m — it returns a well-formed UUID and fires the tracking call. I did [1mnot[0m load
  the page in a browser, so the [38;5;153m<script>[39m ordering in [38;5;153mindex.html[39m is verified by inspection only, not by execution.

  [1mWhat I didn't do.[0m No tests, for the reason in the design: there's no runner, no dependencies, and [38;5;153mapp.js[39m touches
